---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
Chooses nested representations

Usage: app chooser choose [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --required-choice <STRING>
          Text or detailed selection.

          Alternative to the object form; do not combine them. One form is required.

      --required-choice-label <STRING>
          Sets `required_choice.label` Required when `required_choice` is activated.

      --required-choice-count <INTEGER>
          Sets `required_choice.count` Minimum: 0.

      --optional-choice <STRING>
          Text or detailed selection.

          Alternative to the object form; do not combine them. Both forms may be omitted.

      --optional-choice-label <STRING>
          Sets `optional_choice.label` Required when `optional_choice` is activated.

      --optional-choice-count <INTEGER>
          Sets `optional_choice.count` Minimum: 0.

      --settings-outer-choice <STRING>
          Sets `settings.outer_choice`

          Alternative to the object form; do not combine them. One form is required when `settings` is activated.

      --settings-outer-choice-choice <STRING>
          Text or detailed selection.

          Alternative to the object form; do not combine them. One form is required when the object form of `settings.outer_choice` is selected.

      --settings-outer-choice-choice-label <STRING>
          Sets `settings.outer_choice.choice.label` Required when `settings` is activated.

      --settings-outer-choice-choice-count <INTEGER>
          Sets `settings.outer_choice.choice.count` Minimum: 0.

      --settings-required-group-choice <STRING>
          Text or detailed selection.

          Alternative to the object form; do not combine them. One form is required when `settings` is activated.

      --settings-required-group-choice-label <STRING>
          Sets `settings.required_group.choice.label` Required when `settings` is activated.

      --settings-required-group-choice-count <INTEGER>
          Sets `settings.required_group.choice.count` Minimum: 0.

      --settings-optional-group-choice <STRING>
          Text or detailed selection.

          Alternative to the object form; do not combine them. One form is required when `settings.optional_group` is activated.

      --settings-optional-group-choice-label <STRING>
          Sets `settings.optional_group.choice.label` Required when `settings` is activated.

      --settings-optional-group-choice-count <INTEGER>
          Sets `settings.optional_group.choice.count` Minimum: 0.

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
